# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values.

# Server
PORT=3008
# Comma-separated list of origins allowed to call this API. Empty = allow all (dev only).
CORS_ORIGINS=

# --- Openfort: Project Keys (Dashboard -> API Keys) ---
OPENFORT_SECRET_KEY=

# --- Openfort: Shield (Dashboard -> Shield > API Keys) ---
# Required for the app's automatic embedded wallet recovery.
OPENFORT_SHIELD_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
OPENFORT_SHIELD_SECRET_KEY=
OPENFORT_SHIELD_ENCRYPTION_KEY=

# --- Lighter ---
# Defaults to TESTNET — free, faucet-funded, no real money. Onboarding calls POST
# /api/lighter/faucet instead of a real deposit (see docs/lighter-signing-notes.md).
#
# To switch to MAINNET (real funds/gas), uncomment the two lines below this block and comment
# out the testnet ones. LIGHTER_CHAIN_ID is the L2 signing domain, NOT an EVM chain id — get it
# wrong and every signature is silently invalid. Values verified live via each base URL's own
# /api/v1/layer1BasicInfo and lighter-python's endpoint_profiles.py:
#   testnet.zklighter.elliot.ai -> chainId 300 (default below)
#   mainnet.zklighter.elliot.ai -> chainId 304
#   api.rh-testnet.lighter.xyz  -> chainId 300  (Robinhood Chain testnet)
#   api.rh.lighter.xyz          -> chainId 466324 (Robinhood Chain mainnet)
LIGHTER_API_BASE_URL=https://testnet.zklighter.elliot.ai
LIGHTER_CHAIN_ID=300
# LIGHTER_API_BASE_URL=https://mainnet.zklighter.elliot.ai
# LIGHTER_CHAIN_ID=304

# No market config needed — GET /api/lighter/markets discovers every active market (perp + spot)
# live from Lighter on each call, and order/orderbook/cancel routes take marketIndex per request,
# validated against that live list. See server/src/markets.ts.

# Populated after onboarding (see scripts/e2e.md):
# 1. Testnet: tap "Get testnet funds" in the app (calls the faucet, no signature needed).
#    Mainnet: deposit real USDC from the embedded wallet.
#    Either way, Lighter assigns an account_index.
# 2. POST /api/lighter/changepubkey/message + the wallet's personal_sign -> POST .../submit.
# 3. Copy the values the server logs on submit into the three vars below and restart.
LIGHTER_ACCOUNT_INDEX=
LIGHTER_API_KEY_PRIVATE_KEY=
LIGHTER_API_KEY_INDEX=2
